      children: "This orchestrator is deliberately synchronous in its logic even though it uses async I/O. The order of operations matters, and any refactoring that moves the PII redaction step after a storage call would introduce a bug. In a team environment, this invariant should be documented and ideally enforced with a linting rule or integration test that verifies the pipeline order."
    }), "\n", _jsxs(_components.p, {
      children: ["The scope classifier (", _jsx(_components.code, {
