      }), ") is worth mentioning separately. It can be as simple as a keyword lookup or as sophisticated as a fine-tuned classifier. In practice, a few dozen labeled examples fed to a lightweight classifier like a logistic regression over TF-IDF features, or a small prompt sent to a fast model tier, is usually sufficient. What matters is that it runs on the redacted message and that its output is validated against a known set of allowed scopes before being used as a metadata filter."]
    }), "\n", "\n", _jsx(_components.h2, {
