      }), " If policy documents are chunked at arbitrary character boundaries rather than semantic ones (paragraph or section boundaries), retrieval quality drops sharply. If the vector index is not rebuilt when policies change, the agent will answer based on outdated information even though it was supposedly grounded by retrieval. Policy document ingestion needs to be part of your change management workflow, not a one-time setup task."]
    }), "\n", _jsxs(_components.p, {
